# init.comet.rc starts insmod_sh_comet from "on early-boot" after
# wait_for_prop vendor.common.modules.ready, which never fires under
# droid-hal-init. Start it on the property instead: loads Wi-Fi
# (bcmdhd4390), touch (goodix_brl_touch, syna_touch), speaker amps and
# haptics, then sets vendor.all.modules.ready.
on property:vendor.common.modules.ready=1
    start insmod_sh_comet
